   silhouette.svg placeholder) and the file assets/readme/perry.png were
   supplied by the repository owner as an unofficial fan tribute. They are not
   covered by the MIT licence, no licence to it is granted here, and it is not
   affiliated with or endorsed by Disney. The owner will remove it on request
   from the rights holder. Do not copy, reuse or redistribute these files.

2. Third-party software and fonts. Dependencies keep their own licences, which
   are listed in docs/CREDITS.md.

Project preview images in public/projects/ are screenshots and figures from the
owner's public repositories KASCO, NUSH2 and STRATO, each of which carries the
MIT licence.
